The C++ changes of h2oai/LightGBM (tag H2O_v4.6.0.2, on top of v4.6.0),
rebased onto upstream LightGBM v4.7.0 for the ROCm build:

- Boosting::GetTrees() and Tree split accessors, used for MOJO export.
- DAI_LIGHTGBM_AVOID_LOGGER: print log messages even when a log callback is set.
- FindGroups(): account for the default bin when counting bins per group.

The Python changes of the fork (no dask import at package import, no
pkg_resources) are already upstream behaviour in v4.7.0.

